@SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170
@token = paste-a-login-token-here

### Daily attendance: a teacher records one lesson for the section
POST {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/daily-attendance/record-period
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timetableSlotId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "subjectId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "sectionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "gradeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "academicYearId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "date": "2026-11-21",
  "startTime": "08:00:00",
  "students": [
    { "studentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006", "status": 0 },
    { "studentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007", "status": 1, "absenceReason": "Sick" }
  ]
}

### Student evaluation: a teacher evaluates a student in a lesson (ratings 1..5)
POST {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/student-evaluation/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "subjectId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "timetableSlotId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "date": "2026-11-21",
  "focus": 4,
  "interaction": 5,
  "behavior": 5,
  "healthStatus": 0,
  "comment": "Very good participation",
  "evaluationRequestId": null
}

### Evaluation request: a parent asks a teacher to evaluate their child
POST {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/evaluation-request/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "teacherId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
  "subjectId": null,
  "note": "How is he doing in math?"
}

### Bus routes
GET {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/bus-route/get-all
Accept: application/json

### Bus: new bus on a route
POST {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/bus/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "B-01",
  "plateNumber": "ABC 1234",
  "capacity": 30,
  "driverName": "Mahmoud Ali",
  "driverPhone": "0100000000",
  "busRouteId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009"
}

### Bus assignment: students ride a bus with their own bus fee
POST {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/bus-assignment/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "busId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
  "academicYearId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "busRouteStopId": null,
  "studentIds": [ "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006" ],
  "feeAmount": 1500,
  "currency": "EGP",
  "startDate": "2026-09-01",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-01T00:00:00"
}

### Trip: today's trips of a bus
GET {{SchoolManager.Attendance.API_HostAddress}}/api/trip/get-by-date?date=2026-11-21&busId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
Accept: application/json

###
